WEBVTT

00:00:00.473 --> 00:00:02.346
I <b>got up</b> late yesterday.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:07.594
I <b>didn’t get up</b> late yesterday.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.915
They <b>had</b> lunch at a restaurant.

00:00:15.996 --> 00:00:18.643
They <b>didn’t have</b> lunch at a restaurant.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:23.952
<b>Did you go</b> on holiday last summer?

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.368
Yes, <b>I did</b>.

00:00:31.521 --> 00:00:32.811
No, <b>I didn’t</b>.

00:00:35.905 --> 00:00:37.596
Where <b>did you go</b> on holiday?

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.073
We <b>went</b> to Brazil.